        "text": "# Nimbus Campus Hostel Rules & Guidelines\n\n## 1. Gate Timings & Curfew\n- **Main Hostel Gate Closing Time**: 22:00 (10:00 PM) on weekdays (Sunday to Thursday).\n- **Weekend Gate Closing Time**: 23:00 (11:00 PM) on Friday and Saturday.\n- Late entries without prior written approval from the Warden will incur disciplinary action.\n\n## 2. Visitor Regulations\n- Visiting hours: 16:00 to 19:00 only, in designated Common Areas.\n- Outside guests are strictly not permitted inside individual hostel rooms.\n- Overnight stay of non-residents is strictly prohibited.\n\n## 3. Quiet Hours & Conduct\n- **Quiet Hours**: 23:00 to 06:00 every day. Playing loud music or creating disturbances during quiet hours is forbidden.\n- Possession or consumption of alcohol, tobacco, or banned substances on campus premises is strictly banned and results in immediate expulsion.\n\n## 4. Room Maintenance & Electrical Appliances\n- Heavy electrical appliances (induction cookers, immersion heaters, air conditioners) are not permitted in hostel rooms.\n- Residents are responsible for the cleanliness and maintenance of their allocated rooms.\n\n",
